&HEAD CHID='LS_terrain_open_boundary', TITLE='Level set fire spread over a slope that is cut by OPEN boundaries' /

A 30 degree slope, made of a GEOM, rises to 8.2 m inside a 10 m domain whose sides and top are OPEN. The terrain is
cut by the XMIN and YMIN boundaries, and it is higher than the level set wind sample height (6.1 m) below the top
of the domain. The wind follows the terrain (LEVEL_SET_MODE=3) and the fire front is tracked from t=0. The run must
complete and the divergence must remain small.

&MESH IJK=50,50,5, XB=-5,5,-5,5,0,10 /

&TIME T_END=3. /
&MISC LEVEL_SET_MODE=3 /
&RADI RADIATION=F /

&WIND DIRECTION=270, SPEED=5 /

&VENT DB='XMIN', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT DB='XMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT DB='YMIN', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT DB='YMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT DB='ZMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /

&SURF ID='ignition', VEG_LSET_IGNITE_TIME=0., COLOR='RED' /
&VENT XB=-0.1,0.1,-0.1,0.1,0,0, SURF_ID='ignition', GEOM=T /

&SURF ID='fuel', VEG_LSET_ROS_00=0.05 /

&GEOM ID='terrain', SURF_ID='fuel', IJK=2,2, XB=-5,5,-5,5, ZVALS=0.0,4.0825,4.0825,8.165 /

&SLCF AGL_SLICE=0.1, QUANTITY='LEVEL SET VALUE' /
&BNDF QUANTITY='FIRE ARRIVAL TIME' /

&DUMP DT_DEVC=0.25 /

&DEVC XB=-5,5,-5,5,0,10, QUANTITY='DIVERGENCE', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='MAX', ID='div_max' /
&DEVC XB=-5,5,-5,5,0,10, QUANTITY='DIVERGENCE', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='MIN', ID='div_min' /

&TAIL /
